BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:sub1h30-halfmarathon-high-volume-specific-plan
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260609
SUMMARY:Zone 2 Medium-Long
DESCRIPTION:Week 1 (Build 1). Planned distance: 14 km. 14 km easy Zone 2. First 3 km at HR 135-145 and about 5:05-5:35/km. Then settle into HR 140-150 and about 4:55-5:20/km. If you feel very fresh, finish with 4 x 20 s relaxed strides at roughly 3K-5K feel with full walk/jog recovery.
UID:2026-06-09-tue-1@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260611
SUMMARY:Threshold Reps
DESCRIPTION:Week 1 (Build 1). Planned distance: 15 km. Total about 15 km. Warm-up 3 km easy at HR 135-145 and about 5:05-5:35/km, then 4 relaxed strides. Main: 3 x 10 min at controlled threshold, HR about 168-176, roughly 4:14-4:22/km, with 3 min easy jog between reps at HR below 150 and about 5:10-5:45/km. Cool-down easy. The first rep should feel the easiest.
UID:2026-06-11-thu-1@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260614
SUMMARY:Long Easy
DESCRIPTION:Week 1 (Build 1). Planned distance: 21 km. 21 km easy Zone 2. First 5 km at HR 135-145 and about 5:05-5:35/km. Then settle into HR 140-150 and about 4:55-5:20/km. No fast finish. If HR drifts above 152 before the final 3 km, back off.
UID:2026-06-14-sun-1@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260616
SUMMARY:Zone 2 Medium-Long
DESCRIPTION:Week 2 (Build 2). Planned distance: 15 km. 15 km easy Zone 2. Keep the whole run controlled. Aim HR 140-150 for most of the run, roughly 4:55-5:20/km. Start easier than that for the first 2-3 km. Optional 4-6 x 20 s relaxed strides only if legs feel good.
UID:2026-06-16-tue-2@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260618
SUMMARY:Cruise Reps
DESCRIPTION:Week 2 (Build 2). Planned distance: 16 km. Total about 16 km. Warm-up 3 km easy at HR 135-145 and about 5:05-5:35/km. Main: 4 x 2 km at controlled threshold / strong aerobic effort, HR about 166-174, roughly 4:16-4:24/km, with 2 min easy jog between reps at HR below 150 and about 5:10-5:45/km. Cool-down easy. Keep all reps within a few seconds of each other.
UID:2026-06-18-thu-2@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260621
SUMMARY:Long Easy
DESCRIPTION:Week 2 (Build 2). Planned distance: 22 km. 22 km easy Zone 2. First 5 km very calm. Most of the run should sit at HR 140-150 and roughly 4:55-5:20/km. No progression and no steady finish.
UID:2026-06-21-sun-2@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260623
SUMMARY:Zone 2 Medium-Long
DESCRIPTION:Week 3 (Build 3). Planned distance: 15 km. 15 km easy Zone 2 only. HR 140-150 for most of the run, about 4:55-5:20/km, but start easier for the first 3 km. Optional 4 x 20 s strides if you feel light.
UID:2026-06-23-tue-3@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260625
SUMMARY:Continuous Threshold
DESCRIPTION:Week 3 (Build 3). Planned distance: 16 km. Total about 16 km. Warm-up 4 km easy at HR 135-145 and about 5:05-5:35/km, then 4 strides. Main: 30 min continuous threshold at HR 168-176, roughly 4:14-4:22/km. Cool-down easy. The effort should feel controlled and repeatable, not like a race.
UID:2026-06-25-thu-3@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260628
SUMMARY:Long Easy
DESCRIPTION:Week 3 (Build 3). Planned distance: 23 km. 23 km easy Zone 2. HR 140-150 for the main portion, roughly 4:55-5:20/km. If conditions are hot or windy, prioritize HR and ease over pace.
UID:2026-06-28-sun-3@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260630
SUMMARY:Zone 2 Easy
DESCRIPTION:Week 4 (Deload 1). Planned distance: 13 km. 13 km easy Zone 2. HR mostly 135-148 and about 5:00-5:30/km. Purely aerobic.
UID:2026-06-30-tue-4@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260702
SUMMARY:Light Fartlek
DESCRIPTION:Week 4 (Deload 1). Planned distance: 14 km. Total about 14 km. Warm-up 3 km easy at HR 135-145 and about 5:05-5:35/km. Main: 10 x 1 min on / 1 min off. On reps at smooth 10K effort, HR rising through about 165-175, roughly 3:58-4:08/km on flat calm terrain. Off reps as easy jog, HR back toward 145-155 and about 5:10-5:50/km. Cool-down easy. Finish feeling fresh.
UID:2026-07-02-thu-4@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260705
SUMMARY:Long Easy
DESCRIPTION:Week 4 (Deload 1). Planned distance: 19 km. 19 km easy Zone 2. HR mostly 140-150, pace about 4:55-5:20/km. No fast finish.
UID:2026-07-05-sun-4@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260707
SUMMARY:Zone 2 Medium-Long
DESCRIPTION:Week 5 (HM Build 1). Planned distance: 16 km. 16 km easy Zone 2. First 3 km easy at HR 135-145, then most of the run at HR 140-150 and about 4:55-5:20/km. Optional 4 x 20 s strides only if fresh.
UID:2026-07-07-tue-5@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260709
SUMMARY:HM Pace Blocks
DESCRIPTION:Week 5 (HM Build 1). Planned distance: 16 km. Total about 16 km. Warm-up 3 km easy at HR 135-145 and about 5:05-5:35/km, then 4 strides. Main: 3 x 3 km at controlled half-marathon effort, HR about 162-170, roughly 4:16-4:22/km, with 3 min easy jog between reps at HR below 150 and about 5:10-5:45/km. Cool-down easy. Goal = calm and even, not pressing.
UID:2026-07-09-thu-5@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260712
SUMMARY:Long Easy
DESCRIPTION:Week 5 (HM Build 1). Planned distance: 24 km. 24 km easy Zone 2. Most of the run at HR 140-150 and about 4:55-5:20/km. Keep it genuinely easy the whole way.
UID:2026-07-12-sun-5@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260714
SUMMARY:Zone 2 Medium-Long
DESCRIPTION:Week 6 (HM Build 2). Planned distance: 16 km. 16 km easy Zone 2. HR mostly 140-150 and about 4:55-5:20/km. Resist the urge to push late.
UID:2026-07-14-tue-6@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260716
SUMMARY:Threshold Reps
DESCRIPTION:Week 6 (HM Build 2). Planned distance: 17 km. Total about 17 km. Warm-up 3 km easy at HR 135-145 and about 5:05-5:35/km, then 4 strides. Main: 4 x 10 min at threshold, HR 168-176, roughly 4:14-4:22/km, with 2 min easy jog between reps at HR below 150 and about 5:10-5:45/km. Cool-down easy. Rep 1 should be the calmest.
UID:2026-07-16-thu-6@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260719
SUMMARY:Long Easy
DESCRIPTION:Week 6 (HM Build 2). Planned distance: 25 km. 25 km easy Zone 2. HR mostly 140-150, pace about 4:55-5:20/km. No progression.
UID:2026-07-19-sun-6@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260721
SUMMARY:Zone 2 Medium-Long
DESCRIPTION:Week 7 (HM Build 3). Planned distance: 17 km. 17 km easy Zone 2. Aim for HR 140-150 and about 4:55-5:20/km after a very easy opening 3 km. Optional 4-6 x 20 s relaxed strides if fresh.
UID:2026-07-21-tue-7@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260723
SUMMARY:Continuous HM Effort
DESCRIPTION:Week 7 (HM Build 3). Planned distance: 17 km. Total about 17 km. Warm-up 4 km easy at HR 135-145 and about 5:05-5:35/km, then 4 strides. Main: 8 km continuous at controlled half-marathon effort, HR about 162-170, roughly 4:16-4:22/km. Cool-down easy. Only edge quicker if it stays very smooth.
UID:2026-07-23-thu-7@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260726
SUMMARY:Long Easy
DESCRIPTION:Week 7 (HM Build 3). Planned distance: 26 km. 26 km easy Zone 2. HR mostly 140-150, pace roughly 4:55-5:20/km. Keep effort stable and patient.
UID:2026-07-26-sun-7@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
