DESCRIPTION:Week 8 (Deload 2). Planned distance: 14 km. 14 km easy Zone 2. HR mostly 135-148, roughly 5:00-5:30/km. Purely aerobic.
UID:2026-07-28-tue-8@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260730
SUMMARY:1K Rhythm Reps
DESCRIPTION:Week 8 (Deload 2). Planned distance: 15 km. Total about 15 km. Warm-up 3 km easy at HR 135-145 and about 5:05-5:35/km, then 4 strides. Main: 5 x 1 km at around 10K effort, HR rising through about 170-180, roughly 3:58-4:06/km, with 90 s easy jog between reps at HR below 150 and about 5:10-5:45/km. Cool-down easy. Rhythm first, not proving fitness.
UID:2026-07-30-thu-8@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
