SUMMARY:Zone 2 Medium-Long
DESCRIPTION:Week 9 (Peak 1). Planned distance: 17 km. 17 km easy Zone 2. First 3 km easy at HR 135-145, then settle into HR 140-150 and about 4:55-5:20/km.
UID:2026-08-04-tue-9@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
