DESCRIPTION:Week 9 (Peak 1). Planned distance: 18 km. Total about 18 km. Warm-up 4 km easy at HR 135-145 and about 5:05-5:35/km, then 4 strides. Main: 2 x 5 km at controlled half-marathon effort, HR about 162-170, roughly 4:16-4:22/km, with 4 min easy jog at HR below 150 and about 5:10-5:45/km. Cool-down easy. Goal = rhythm, not strain.
