SUMMARY:Zone 2 Medium-Long
DESCRIPTION:Week 10 (Peak 2). Planned distance: 16 km. 16 km easy Zone 2. HR mostly 140-150 and about 4:55-5:20/km. Optional 4 x 20 s relaxed strides if fresh.
