END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260813
SUMMARY:Threshold + HM Finish
DESCRIPTION:Week 10 (Peak 2). Planned distance: 17 km. Total about 17 km. Warm-up 3 km easy at HR 135-145 and about 5:05-5:35/km, then 4 strides. Main: 20 min threshold at HR 168-176 and roughly 4:14-4:22/km, 5 min easy jog, then 4 km at half-marathon effort at HR 162-170 and roughly 4:16-4:22/km. Cool-down easy.
UID:2026-08-13-thu-10@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260816
SUMMARY:Long Easy with Controlled Finish
DESCRIPTION:Week 10 (Peak 2). Planned distance: 26 km. 26 km total. First 20 km easy Zone 2 at HR 140-150 and about 4:55-5:20/km. Final 6 km steady but controlled at HR 150-158 and about 4:35-4:50/km. Skip the finish block if tired or conditions are poor.
UID:2026-08-16-sun-10@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260818
SUMMARY:Zone 2 Easy
DESCRIPTION:Week 11 (Taper 1). Planned distance: 13 km. 13 km easy Zone 2. HR mostly 135-148 and about 5:00-5:30/km.
UID:2026-08-18-tue-11@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
