SUMMARY:HM Tune-Up
DESCRIPTION:Week 11 (Taper 1). Planned distance: 15 km. Total about 15 km. Warm-up 3 km easy at HR 135-145 and about 5:05-5:35/km, then 4 strides. Main: 2 x 4 km at controlled half-marathon effort, HR about 162-170, roughly 4:16-4:22/km, with 3 min easy jog between reps at HR below 150 and about 5:10-5:45/km. Cool-down easy. Smooth and confident.
UID:2026-08-20-thu-11@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
