SUMMARY:Long Easy
DESCRIPTION:Week 11 (Taper 1). Planned distance: 18 km. 18 km easy Zone 2. HR mostly 140-150 and about 4:55-5:20/km. No progression.
UID:2026-08-23-sun-11@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260825
SUMMARY:Zone 2 Easy + Strides
DESCRIPTION:Week 12 (Race Week). Planned distance: 10 km. 10 km easy Zone 2. HR mostly 135-145 and about 5:05-5:35/km, then 4-6 x 20 s relaxed strides with full recovery.
UID:2026-08-25-tue-12@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260827
SUMMARY:Sharpener
DESCRIPTION:Week 12 (Race Week). Planned distance: 10 km. Total about 10 km. Warm-up 3 km easy at HR 135-145 and about 5:05-5:35/km, then 4 strides. Main: 3 x 1 km at goal half-marathon effort, HR about 160-168, roughly 4:16-4:20/km, with 2 min easy jog. Cool-down easy. Finish feeling fresh.
UID:2026-08-27-thu-12@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260830
SUMMARY:Half Marathon Race / Time Trial
DESCRIPTION:Week 12 (Race Week). Planned distance: 21.1 km. Half marathon. Warm-up 10-15 min easy plus 4 short strides. Race plan: first 3 km at about 4:18-4:20/km and controlled HR, middle 10 km around 4:15-4:18/km if smooth, final 5-8 km race by feel. Do not bank time early.
UID:2026-08-30-sun-12@hmhighvolspecific
END:VEVENT
